---
description: Visual rules for the shop and the desk
globs: "**/*.{tsx,css}"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow DESIGN.md. Use the Wet Edge CSS tokens (gesso, plate, ink, cobalt, per-piece pour).

Display and UI type is Bricolage Grotesque. Prose and captions are Newsreader.

Tap targets stay at least 44px. Prices use tabular numbers.

Support reduced motion: when `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` is active, disable smooth scroll and GSAP scrubbed animations, rendering final states immediately.

Photographs showcase real artworks from the Collegeville studio. Never introduce fake placeholder art or generic stock images.
